WEBVTT

00:06.000 --> 00:08.330
<b>What in the world is going on...?</b>

01:44.750 --> 01:50.330
<b>HOMECOMING, NEW, RESOLVE</b>

01:46.210 --> 01:48.000
<b>I enjoyed celebrating spring</b>

01:48.250 --> 01:50.380
<b>amid the flowering cherry blossoms.</b>

01:51.130 --> 01:55.130
<b>I enjoyed breathing in the fragrance
of fresh green leaves as I ran.</b>

01:55.710 --> 01:59.040
<b>We would live our whole lives with nature at our side.</b>

02:06.080 --> 02:08.210
<b>That's what I thought, but...</b>

02:51.380 --> 02:52.880
<b>Back off!</b>

02:52.880 --> 02:54.290
<b>With me, Yuuki!</b>

03:04.420 --> 03:07.630
<b>Our objective is complete. We should go, Shikoku.</b>

03:08.130 --> 03:10.250
<b>Head back without me, Jouryuu.</b>

03:10.580 --> 03:12.500
<b>I'm going to stay here and watch.</b>

03:12.790 --> 03:17.540
<b>That Shuuki's pretty strong!
I want to see how this plays out.</b>

03:17.830 --> 03:18.880
<b>Alright then.</b>

03:21.210 --> 03:22.380
<b>Make it quick.</b>

03:29.170 --> 03:30.250
<b>Focus...</b>

03:39.330 --> 03:40.460
<b>Focus...!</b>

03:45.540 --> 03:47.170
<b>SLAVE SUPPORT FIST</b>

03:49.580 --> 03:52.170
<b>I learned how to step up my game
during our training sessions.</b>

03:56.330 --> 03:58.460
<b>And I have good reason not to lose!</b>

04:27.330 --> 04:29.290
<b>It won't stop...!</b>

04:35.130 --> 04:36.130
<b>Miss Kyouka!</b>

04:36.380 --> 04:37.130
<b>Here it comes!</b>

04:55.500 --> 04:59.080
<b>I could even channel my strength into my mouth!</b>

05:00.750 --> 05:02.920
<b>Whoa! Talk about dangerous!</b>

05:02.920 --> 05:04.330
<b>I like this guy!</b>

05:19.630 --> 05:22.830
<b>I know you're angry, Unihorn. But that's too bad...</b>

05:23.460 --> 05:26.210
<b>Because MY rage burns
a hundred times hotter than yours!</b>

05:35.210 --> 05:36.000
<b>Miss Kyouka!</b>

05:40.080 --> 05:41.630
<b>This is where you die.</b>

05:44.290 --> 05:47.250
<b>The technique I learned just to carve you into pieces...</b>

05:53.920 --> 05:55.960
<b>Howling Cherry Blossom!</b>

05:57.710 --> 06:00.000
<b>No countering or dodging me this time!</b>

06:00.500 --> 06:02.580
<b>With the unyielding swing of my blade...</b>

06:02.580 --> 06:04.460
<b>...YOU WILL PERISH!</b>

06:10.130 --> 06:14.460
<b>It's time... TO BOW DOWN!</b>

06:25.630 --> 06:26.580
<b>Miss Kyouka...</b>

06:30.330 --> 06:31.290
<b>Kyou...</b>

06:38.630 --> 06:39.500
<b>She's gone...</b>

06:40.080 --> 06:41.460
<b>Go gather up the others.</b>

06:41.880 --> 06:42.630
<b>Got it.</b>

06:51.540 --> 06:53.330
<b>This victory...</b>

06:55.670 --> 06:57.790
<b>...is for my hometown.</b>

07:11.130 --> 07:13.790
<b>That was quite the spectacular battle.</b>

07:14.210 --> 07:17.000
<b>The commander of the 7th Squadron
is pretty impressive, too.</b>

07:17.880 --> 07:19.670
<b>But more importantly...</b>

07:19.670 --> 07:20.880
<b>That man.</b>

07:22.460 --> 07:24.460
<b>He seems like fun!</b>

07:32.710 --> 07:34.710
<b>Big Sis! Are you hurt?</b>

07:35.670 --> 07:38.380
<b>Nah, it's okay. I'll heal up fast.</b>

07:41.040 --> 07:42.290
<b>Miss Tenka?!</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:43.210
<b>Hey, guys.</b>

07:43.380 --> 07:45.710
<b>You didn't have to come back right away like that!</b>

07:46.420 --> 07:49.250
<b>This is a family issue, so I ought to be here.</b>

07:49.540 --> 07:51.210
<b>Don't worry about the others.</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:54.670
<b>Nei's doing a great job handling the situation.</b>

07:56.290 --> 07:58.040
<b>What are you going to do now?</b>

08:00.170 --> 08:02.460
<b>Can't say I feel like leading a revolt.</b>

08:02.750 --> 08:04.960
<b>All the Shuuki we rallied are gone.</b>

08:04.960 --> 08:07.080
<b>Plus they abducted Coco and Naon...</b>

08:07.540 --> 08:10.040
<b>But still... I HAVE to save them.</b>

08:10.580 --> 08:12.330
<b>Are you willing to let me protect you?</b>

08:13.540 --> 08:17.880
<b>If you don't plan on causing trouble,
there's no reason for us to fight.</b>

08:18.250 --> 08:20.580
<b>If anything, you're a victim of a Mato Mishap.</b>

08:20.830 --> 08:23.330
<b>I'll do everything in my power to rescue your friends.</b>

08:24.170 --> 08:26.580
<b>Same here. I want to help you.</b>

08:27.250 --> 08:30.250
<b>We won't let the Onmyou Bureau
touch you either. Trust me.</b>

08:30.460 --> 08:31.500
<b>Big Sis?</b>

08:35.580 --> 08:40.250
<b>I trust Tenka and Kyouka,
but I can't trust the organization as a whole.</b>

08:40.330 --> 08:42.830
<b>But you can't stay here anymore!</b>

08:42.830 --> 08:46.500
<b>We've got other villages.
My friends are already on the move.</b>

08:46.920 --> 08:49.210
<b>It's my job to look after them.</b>

08:51.250 --> 08:56.580
<b>If they have somewhere to hide, then choosing
not to accept our offer would be a sensible decision.</b>

08:56.580 --> 08:57.500
<b>What?!</b>

08:58.170 --> 09:00.130
<b>Supreme Commander Yamashiro...</b>

09:00.500 --> 09:06.040
<b>If the Onmyou Bureau really is conducting these
experiments, there's a decent chance she's aware of it.</b>

09:07.630 --> 09:11.670
<b>The Supreme Commander,
AKA the leader of the Demon Defense Force.</b>

09:11.880 --> 09:13.210
<b>But why does that matter?</b>

09:13.880 --> 09:19.330
<b>It's nice to have a Supreme Commander
who's so patriotic, but she's a little unnerving...</b>

09:19.580 --> 09:23.330
<b>I couldn't bring myself to attack Aoba during our fight...</b>

09:23.750 --> 09:27.000
<b>But I bet the Supreme Commander
wouldn't even hesitate.</b>

09:27.750 --> 09:31.500
<b>Whether it's right or wrong isn't the point.
That's just how she is.</b>

09:32.330 --> 09:36.210
<b>Which is why hiding might actually be
a safer option at the moment.</b>

09:36.790 --> 09:40.130
<b>Luckily, the conversations
we've had haven't left this cave.</b>

09:40.750 --> 09:42.880
<b>And we can investigate the Onmyou Bureau.</b>

09:43.540 --> 09:46.960
<b>Then how long will my sister
and her friends have to hide...?</b>

09:47.420 --> 09:48.580
<b>That's an easy one.</b>

09:49.040 --> 09:49.880
<b>Huh?</b>

10:08.580 --> 10:10.170
<b>Hi Nei, we're back from-</b>

10:11.540 --> 10:14.580
<b>Welcome home! I'm so glad you're okay!</b>

10:14.920 --> 10:18.670
<b>Sorry for making you worry.
I owe everyone else for saving me.</b>

10:19.330 --> 10:20.920
<b>How are Himari and the others?</b>

10:21.250 --> 10:24.210
<b>They'll be cleared to come back
after two or three days of bed rest.</b>

10:24.540 --> 10:25.460
<b>Good.</b>

10:25.710 --> 10:28.290
<b>Then I'm off to get my injuries looked at, too.</b>

10:28.920 --> 10:31.420
<b>I'll check in on Himari and the others while I'm there.</b>

10:31.670 --> 10:32.540
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:35.670 --> 10:36.710
<b>Miss Tenka!</b>

10:37.670 --> 10:38.380
<b>I, um...</b>

10:39.790 --> 10:43.750
<b>The next time we're alone,
I expect a VERY generous reward.</b>

10:44.420 --> 10:44.920
<b>Huh?</b>

10:47.920 --> 10:49.750
<b>Catch you later, Yuuki.</b>

10:54.380 --> 10:58.000
<b>Nei has to go drop off a change of clothes
for Miss Himari and Miss Shushu.</b>

10:58.420 --> 11:00.330
<b>Feel free to unwind in the bath!</b>

11:00.750 --> 11:02.170
<b>I think I'll do just that.</b>

11:02.330 --> 11:04.880
<b>Yuuki, stand by in your Slave form.</b>

11:05.330 --> 11:07.670
<b>Come get me at the first sign of an enemy attack.</b>

11:08.040 --> 11:08.830
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

11:09.380 --> 11:12.830
<b>You must be hungry by now.
Are you up to eating dinner?</b>

11:12.830 --> 11:14.540
<b>Uh, sure...</b>

11:17.250 --> 11:20.000
<b>You're not in pain or anything, are you?</b>

11:20.210 --> 11:22.170
<b>No, I'm fine.</b>

11:22.420 --> 11:24.540
<b>It's just... the others are...</b>

11:24.540 --> 11:27.130
<b>The Demon Defense Force has a talented medical team.</b>

11:27.130 --> 11:29.000
<b>They'll bounce back soon enough!</b>

11:29.630 --> 11:31.790
<b>Yeah, that's what Miss Kyouka said...</b>

11:34.790 --> 11:40.290
<b>If something happens, it's your job to work extra hard
on behalf of everyone who's in the hospital!</b>

11:43.500 --> 11:46.710
<b>So eat something when you can, and try to cheer up!</b>

11:47.130 --> 11:48.710
<b>Senpai's orders!</b>

11:49.210 --> 11:51.000
<b>Got it. Thanks.</b>

11:54.290 --> 11:56.380
<b>I'll go grab you some food!</b>

11:56.460 --> 11:59.380
<b>Take your time, Nei! And be careful!</b>

11:59.380 --> 12:01.960
<b>Don't worry! I'm your senpai, remember?!</b>

12:11.790 --> 12:13.580
<b>I'm disengaging my ability now.</b>

12:13.880 --> 12:14.710
<b>Okay.</b>

12:20.000 --> 12:22.670
<b>Go rinse off in the shower before your reward begins.</b>

12:24.830 --> 12:27.500
<b>After that... meet me in my room.</b>

12:27.750 --> 12:28.670
<b>Be quick about it.</b>

12:28.670 --> 12:29.670
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

12:34.290 --> 12:35.460
<b>Is this...?</b>

12:52.380 --> 12:56.130
<b>Apparently... your reward is sleeping in my bed with me.</b>

12:56.420 --> 12:58.170
<b>Oh, okay then...</b>

12:58.420 --> 13:03.290
<b>I know that rest is important,
but the lack of clothing is absurd.</b>

13:18.960 --> 13:20.420
<b>You pervert.</b>

13:21.170 --> 13:22.380
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

13:22.380 --> 13:25.790
<b>You'll be exhausted if you don't get some sleep.
And the reward won't end.</b>

13:26.380 --> 13:28.330
<b>I think I'm wide awake...</b>

13:28.750 --> 13:29.710
<b>Really?</b>

13:32.040 --> 13:34.330
<b>In that case, perhaps we should do something else.</b>

13:34.330 --> 13:36.250
<b>Huh? W-wait...!</b>

13:36.250 --> 13:38.630
<b>Sit still. Trust me on this.</b>

13:39.040 --> 13:42.750
<b>The price of my ability only lets me move so far, but...</b>

13:42.750 --> 13:45.330
<b>Wh-what's the point of this again?!</b>

13:45.670 --> 13:48.920
<b>To make sure you understand that I am your master.</b>

13:48.920 --> 13:50.960
<b>I'm fully aware of that!</b>

13:51.210 --> 13:56.040
<b>Except you ignored my orders,
obeyed your sister instead, and got yourself captured!</b>

13:57.790 --> 14:03.040
<b>I'm sorry! I didn't mean to...
It was just a knee-jerk reaction...!</b>

14:03.040 --> 14:05.500
<b>I surrender! Please, please, please, please...!</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:08.500
<b>Your sister always used to put you
in a headlock, didn't she?</b>

14:08.790 --> 14:12.710
<b>You'll need extensive disciplining,
but I'll start by using the same method.</b>

14:12.920 --> 14:17.670
<b>Th-the fact that I'm okay with this is a little concerning...!</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:22.750
<b>I swear...</b>

14:25.630 --> 14:27.170
<b>Now get some rest.</b>

14:36.540 --> 14:38.670
<b>Why did you bring two of them here?</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:40.210
<b>Insurance.</b>

14:40.330 --> 14:43.630
<b>For when it decides to be picky about its food.</b>

14:43.790 --> 14:45.170
<b>You spoil that damn thing.</b>

14:45.750 --> 14:49.080
<b>Then again, it DOES need food to grow...</b>

14:49.500 --> 14:52.210
<b>It's the only god that ever has.</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:55.580
<b>That just means it's going to be a powerful one.</b>

14:56.540 --> 15:00.000
<b>Hear that? You get to live forever inside a god!</b>

15:03.040 --> 15:04.380
<b>This seems promising.</b>

15:04.790 --> 15:08.790
<b>Our newest friend... And she's about to be born!</b>

15:13.330 --> 15:14.710
<b>A whole feast!</b>

15:15.130 --> 15:19.040
<b>To celebrate your return and as a way
of showing my gratitude, I pulled out all the stops!</b>

15:19.330 --> 15:21.960
<b>So this one of Yuuki's famous home-cooked meals...</b>

15:21.960 --> 15:24.670
<b>It smells AND looks delicious!</b>

15:25.210 --> 15:27.040
<b>We can make ramen with the leftover broth.</b>

15:27.290 --> 15:28.380
<b>Yes please!</b>

15:28.380 --> 15:31.380
<b>I can't believe you have an appetite
for something so lowbrow.</b>

15:31.380 --> 15:33.580
<b>Well, you're welcome to not eat it, Yachiho.</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:39.380
<b>No, no. It's my responsibility as your big sister to assess
your taste in food, no matter how disasterous it may be.</b>

15:39.380 --> 15:42.790
<b>But Yacchi, you like that kinda stuff a surprising amount!</b>

15:42.790 --> 15:45.290
<b>You're always sneaking snacks and sweets, too!</b>

15:45.580 --> 15:47.080
<b>Zip it, wouldja?! Don't tell them that!</b>

15:45.580 --> 15:48.250
<b>Um, I think we should...</b>

15:47.080 --> 15:50.460
<b>C'mon, just be honest!</b>

15:48.250 --> 15:49.790
<b>Let's raise a toast!</b>

15:49.790 --> 15:51.960
<b>Yeah. Everyone grab a glass.</b>

15:55.790 --> 15:57.000
<b>Oh, that's right...</b>

15:57.420 --> 16:00.960
<b>YOU'RE the star this time around.
You should give the speech.</b>

16:01.130 --> 16:03.000
<b>Huh? M-me?</b>

16:06.630 --> 16:08.960
<b>Okay then... Uh...</b>

16:09.920 --> 16:13.330
<b>I want to thank each and every one of you
for coming to save me!</b>

16:13.330 --> 16:14.580
<b>It's something I'll never-</b>

16:14.580 --> 16:16.580
<b>Time's up! Cheers!</b>

16:16.580 --> 16:18.420
<b>Cheers!</b>

16:18.630 --> 16:19.710
<b>Seriously?!</b>

16:20.830 --> 16:23.250
<b>What should I eat first...?</b>

16:21.750 --> 16:24.000
<b>Let me give it to you elegantly!</b>

16:24.000 --> 16:25.960
<b>No thanks, I can do it myself!</b>

16:26.710 --> 16:29.880
<b>Oh, how I've missed Yukki's cooking! It's the best!</b>

16:29.880 --> 16:32.080
<b>Nei helped out a lot, too!</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:35.170
<b>Are you SURE I can't have Yuuki?</b>

16:35.170 --> 16:36.000
<b>Shut up.</b>

16:36.000 --> 16:38.540
<b>Aw, not even for a day...?</b>

16:37.250 --> 16:38.540
<b>Um, guys...?</b>

16:38.540 --> 16:39.830
<b>Yuuki is MY slave.</b>

16:39.290 --> 16:40.920
<b>That reminds me, Yukki...</b>

16:41.830 --> 16:44.130
<b>We forgot to tell you something
while we were in the hospital.</b>

16:45.250 --> 16:46.880
<b>Welcome home, Yuuki.</b>

16:52.750 --> 16:53.710
<b>Glad to be here.</b>

17:01.210 --> 17:02.250
<b>Big Sis...</b>

17:04.000 --> 17:05.540
<b>That's an easy one.</b>

17:05.670 --> 17:06.290
<b>Huh?</b>

17:08.170 --> 17:10.380
<b>I just have to become Supreme Commander.</b>

17:12.830 --> 17:15.290
<b>I'll change the Demon Defense Force's policies.</b>

17:15.580 --> 17:20.920
<b>I'll exterminate the Shuuki, protect Aoba and her friends,
and find a way to cure them.</b>

17:21.250 --> 17:22.580
<b>How does that sound?</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:26.960
<b>In that case, we might finally get to rest easy.</b>

17:27.290 --> 17:28.420
<b>Big Sis...!</b>

17:30.330 --> 17:31.130
<b>An earthquake?!</b>

17:31.710 --> 17:34.080
<b>The cave's collapsing. We need to leave ASAP.</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:35.420
<b>Got it!</b>

17:36.330 --> 17:38.630
<b>Big Sis, let's get to the exit together.</b>

17:41.210 --> 17:42.210
<b>Big Sis?</b>

17:47.750 --> 17:49.250
<b>Fix that for me.</b>

17:51.630 --> 17:52.540
<b>Big Sis!</b>

17:54.630 --> 17:57.040
<b>It's alright. I'll be watching over you.</b>

17:59.460 --> 18:00.710
<b>It won't hold much longer!</b>

18:01.040 --> 18:01.750
<b>Yuuki.</b>

18:02.040 --> 18:06.500
<b>I... I swear I'll figure out a way to help you, Big Sis!</b>

18:08.460 --> 18:11.290
<b>You've gotten so strong! You get an A+!</b>

18:21.040 --> 18:25.290
<b>Up till now, I've been fighting
because I wanted to be a hero.</b>

18:25.630 --> 18:28.420
<b>But... it's not just that anymore.</b>

18:28.830 --> 18:32.630
<b>To cure my big sister. THAT'S my reason for fighting!</b>

18:43.630 --> 18:44.920
<b>Good morning.</b>

18:44.920 --> 18:45.880
<b>Miss Tenka?!</b>

18:46.080 --> 18:47.880
<b>What are you doing in my room?!</b>

18:47.880 --> 18:49.130
<b>I told you, didn't I?</b>

18:49.130 --> 18:52.500
<b>That I expected a generous reward when we were alone.</b>

18:52.960 --> 18:56.460
<b>So I was admiring your adorable face
while you were asleep.</b>

18:56.880 --> 18:59.540
<b>Yuuki! How long are you going to stay in bed?!</b>

19:04.630 --> 19:06.080
<b>Again, Tenka?</b>

19:06.080 --> 19:09.170
<b>Given your recent absence,
don't you have paperwork to catch up on?</b>

19:09.420 --> 19:11.000
<b>Right you are!</b>

19:13.920 --> 19:16.290
<b>Well, see you next time, Yuuki!</b>

19:18.040 --> 19:19.330
<b>Honestly...</b>

19:19.580 --> 19:24.040
<b>N-now, now! Miss Tenka
was just dropping by to say hello!</b>

19:25.580 --> 19:28.080
<b>That "honestly" was meant for YOU!</b>

19:28.080 --> 19:28.750
<b>What?</b>

19:29.330 --> 19:32.380
<b>Evidently, you still don't understand who your master is.</b>

19:32.960 --> 19:35.210
<b>You need discipline. Brace yourself.</b>

19:35.290 --> 19:36.080
<b>Huh?</b>

19:36.830 --> 19:40.130
<b>Please, please, please, please! I surrender!</b>

19:43.420 --> 19:45.960
<b>Why are you already tired when I JUST called you here?</b>

19:45.960 --> 19:48.380
<b>Miss Kyouka put me through the wringer...</b>

19:48.750 --> 19:52.290
<b>Hm... Extra training? Sounds like something she'd do.</b>

19:52.670 --> 19:54.540
<b>What did you want to talk about?</b>

19:54.540 --> 19:56.500
<b>I want to hone my Peach ability, too.</b>

19:57.250 --> 19:58.540
<b>You mean Learning?</b>

19:59.040 --> 20:02.880
<b>I want to get stronger...
so I can be an asset to the commander.</b>

20:04.750 --> 20:08.380
<b>Which is why I need your help, Yuuki.</b>

20:10.000 --> 20:10.960
<b>Sure!</b>

20:14.250 --> 20:17.290
<b>Be patient, Shushu. Now's not the time to act.</b>

20:17.670 --> 20:21.080
<b>Remember what you uncovered
on the Internet during your hospital stay:</b>

20:21.710 --> 20:23.880
<b>The art of war applies to romance, too!</b>

20:24.540 --> 20:26.960
<b>Instead of vying for attention, I need to act aloof!</b>

20:27.500 --> 20:31.790
<b>According to my analysis,
Yukki's love levels look something like this...</b>

20:32.290 --> 20:34.710
<b>If I don't use my brain, I can't win the game!</b>

20:35.130 --> 20:37.750
<b>'Tis all exactly as I envisioned it.</b>

20:37.830 --> 20:40.210
<b>What's she doing over there...?</b>

20:42.210 --> 20:45.080
<b>Hey, guys! A gateway just opened up!</b>

20:45.080 --> 20:46.630
<b>Get ready for battle!</b>

20:48.830 --> 20:49.830
<b>What's the situation?</b>

20:49.830 --> 20:53.290
<b>I'm not currently detecting anyone
in need of rescue near the gateway,</b>

20:53.540 --> 20:56.460
<b>but more and more Shuuki are converging on the site.</b>

20:56.710 --> 20:58.210
<b>Then we'd better hurry!</b>

20:58.210 --> 21:00.500
<b>We're counting on you, Yuuki.</b>

21:00.670 --> 21:01.330
<b>Roger!</b>

21:06.330 --> 21:08.130
